    description: "Join the Matchday Workforce team delivering large-scale soccer events across North America.",
    responsibilities: ["The Training Site Venue Transport Supervisor will play a pivotal role within the Matchday Workforce Transport team, collaborating closely with the Matchday Workforce Team Services team. This position is responsible for assisting with the conceptualization and operational planning of all transportation operations provided to constituents at Venue Specific Training Sites and Team Base Camp Training Sites. We are looking for a self-starter and multitasker who thrives under pressure and is committed to following through on tasks.","Key responsibilities and oversights of the Training Site Venue Transport Supervisor for This major tournament include:","Ensure cost-effective and efficient operations at training sites.","Assist the Manager in developing plans and budgets while managing all operational activities for Venue Specific Training Sites and Team Base Camp Training Sites.","Create comprehensive Transport Plans for all constituents at Venue Specific Training Sites and Team Base Camp Training Sites.","Help develop interim access plans for Club tournament Training Sites.","Coordinate with key stakeholders to secure necessary agreements and approvals.","Collaborate with all Matchday Workforce Functional Areas and transport systems to align plans with overall transport proposals."],
