    qualifications: ["We work hard.","We are dedicated, ambitious and innovative.","And we respect our values. Always.","For all roles, we seek talented people with an entrepreneurial spirit and a global mindset.","The specific competencies we require for this position are:","Proven experience (10+ years) working in an international sports and/or media organisation – with a specific background in football and/or journalism","Digital communications expertise and the ability to build and maintain an audience and maintain interest over time","Excellent English skills, including writing, communication, and presentation"],
