    responsibilities: ["Reporting organizationally to the Fan Operations Venue Lead, the Gate Supervisor will be a key member of the Matchday Workforce Fan Operations team, and work in close collaboration with other key individuals responsible for delivering a seamless fan experience from the Last Mile to the Stadium. The main responsibilities and oversights of the Gate Supervisor for This major tournament include:","Responsible for the match day management of assigned Fan Operations Volunteers including being the first point of contact for questions, coordinating deployments and breaks, ensuring their welfare as well as collecting and providing feedback","Provide regular reports and updates to Fan Operations Coordinator regarding the performance and status of the gate operations and volunteers","Observe any crowd flow issues and raise accordingly. Communicate necessary action to volunteers.","Monitor gate operations to ensure adherence to security and access control procedures and raise concerns accordingly to Fan Operations Venue Lead","Collaborate with security, operations and management teams to improve processes","Ensure compliance with company policies, safety regulations, and legal requirements","Communicate effectively with customers, vendors, and other stakeholders to resolve any issues and maintain positive relationships"],
